          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Curve acceleration limit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sideways acceleration allowed in curves. The vehicle slows&lt;br/&gt;down so that speed squared times curvature stays below this&lt;br/&gt;value. Higher = faster through bends, lower = gentler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 1.50 m/s²&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
