          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Keys take over the route&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On: pressing a steer or speed key while a route is running&lt;br/&gt;cancels the route and hands control back to you. Off: those&lt;br/&gt;keys are ignored during a route. The brake key always pauses&lt;br/&gt;the route while it is held.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: on&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
