           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;No-progress timeout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the vehicle gains less than 0.2 m along the route for&lt;br/&gt;this long, the route is declared impossible and the run&lt;br/&gt;stops. Waiting at a direction change, holding the brake key&lt;br/&gt;and pausing the simulation are not counted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 8 s&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
