          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Max. deviation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Distance from the drawn line beyond which the vehicle counts&lt;br/&gt;as 'off the route'. Being off the route only fails the run&lt;br/&gt;if it lasts for the 'Fail distance'. Raise it if good routes&lt;br/&gt;are rejected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 1.0 m&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
