           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Max. outlines in swept area&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Upper limit for the number of vehicle outlines merged into&lt;br/&gt;the swept area. On very long routes the spacing is increased&lt;br/&gt;to stay below this limit, which keeps the preview&lt;br/&gt;responsive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 450&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
          </property>
