          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bending limit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maximum angle between tractor and trailer that the&lt;br/&gt;controller assumes. A different value is used only if the&lt;br/&gt;vehicle exposes its own bending limit under an attribute&lt;br/&gt;name the controller recognises. The controller never&lt;br/&gt;commands more than the 'Safety fraction' times this angle,&lt;br/&gt;and stops the run as a jackknife close to it. A value that&lt;br/&gt;is too low makes tight reverse turns impossible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 45 °&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
