        <item row="106" column="0">
         <widget class="QLabel" name="lblRouteTrailerSafety">
          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Safety fraction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fraction of the bending limit the controller may command&lt;br/&gt;when reversing. Lower = more margin against jackknifing but&lt;br/&gt;wider turns are needed. It is also limited by the angle the&lt;br/&gt;steering lock can hold.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 0.80&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
