          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Jackknife stop fraction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The run is stopped as a jackknife when the angle between&lt;br/&gt;tractor and trailer exceeds this fraction of the bending&lt;br/&gt;limit. Normally only reached when a situation is forced, for&lt;br/&gt;example starting a reverse from an already large angle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 0.97&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
