          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trailer look-ahead (minimum)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Smallest look-ahead distance for the trailer axle. It takes&lt;br/&gt;over for short trailers, where the factor above would give a&lt;br/&gt;very short look-ahead. Raising it makes the trailer cut&lt;br/&gt;curves more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 2.0 m&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
