          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Max. angle lead&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The wanted angle between tractor and trailer may run at most&lt;br/&gt;this far ahead of the real angle. It only matters at the&lt;br/&gt;start of tight reverse turns; on gentle routes it has no&lt;br/&gt;effect. Very low values (below about 10 degrees) slow down&lt;br/&gt;building the angle and make tight turns harder to follow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Default: 20 °&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
          </property>
